        {
          "text": "na kweethĩwa, yĩla Valao womisye ngoo yake ndakatũlekye tũthi, Yeova nĩwoaie makithathi onthe nthĩ ya Misili, ĩkithathi ya mũndũ, o na ĩkithathi ya nyamũ: kwondũ wa ũu nĩthembee Yeova onthe ala mambaa kuma ĩvunĩ ya nyinyia, me maũme; ĩndĩ makithathi onthe ananĩ makwa nĩnovoasya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
